          />

          <div class="service-intro-image">
            <img src="/images/solar/solar-rows-3.webp" alt="Clean solar panel glass under a blue sky — the finish we work to on Bristol rooftops" loading="lazy" />
          </div>

          <div class="service-features">
            <h3 class="service-features__title">What Our Bristol Solar Cleaning Includes</h3>
            <ul class="features-grid">
              <li class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card__icon">
                  <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7h18M6 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h8a2 2 0 002-2V7"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="feature-card__title">Soft-Bristle Pole Cleaning</strong>
                  <p class="feature-card__body">Glass scrubbed gently at pole length and rinsed at low pressure — no lance stripes, no scratching.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card__icon">
                  <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="feature-card__title">Nobody Walks The Roof</strong>
                  <p class="feature-card__body">The array and the tiles below stay untouched — point-loading glass is how micro-cracks start.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-card__icon">
                  <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="feature-card__title">Bird Dropping Removal</strong>
                  <p class="feature-card__body">The worst soiling on any array — dried-on droppings dissolved and lifted off, not blasted.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
