                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="feature-card__title">Frames & Rails Wiped</strong>
                  <p class="feature-card__body">Frame lines and rails cleaned down, with the array checked over while we are at it.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

