                <div class="process-step__badge">1</div>
                <div class="process-step__content">
                  <h4 class="process-step__title">Quote From The Photos</h4>
                  <p class="process-step__body">The array is looked at from the ground first — panel count and access noted, fixed price agreed before we start.</p>
                </div>
